Ravana orders Shuka Sarana to count disguised host --- Spies in monkey guise cannot number boundless army --- Vibhishana seizes disguised spies and brings to Rama --- Spies confess Ravana sent them to learn strength --- Rama laughs to release them after full viewing --- Rama sends dawn challenge to display Ravana strength --- Freed spies praise four guardians and urge peace --- Spies warn Lanka falls to Rama alone and counsel returning Sita
